          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "One-two Move"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Hallod makes two Strikes, one with each hand; he usually attacks first with his kukri.\n\nIf this first attack hits, the target is flat-footed to the second attack (which for Hallod is usually a fist Strike). The multiple attack penalty applies to these attacks as normal."
            },
